    "name": "Eyes Never Wake",
    "steam_appid": 2526200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It watches you through your webcam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/1b9bceedff23cd64d776d67fb5bb3928.poster.avif?t=1741783630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/1b9bceedff23cd64d776d67fb5bb3928.webm?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/1b9bceedff23cd64d776d67fb5bb3928.mp4?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game where the monster can see you through your webcam\u2014physically duck beneath your real-life desk to hide during intense stealth and chase sequences. Don't let it catch even a glimpse of your face.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blurring the line between game and reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/b2f4271902460c2463399241257300b7.poster.avif?t=1741783630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/b2f4271902460c2463399241257300b7.webm?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/b2f4271902460c2463399241257300b7.mp4?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses various webcam and fourth-wall-breaking interactions to create a deeply immersive horror experience where your real-world actions matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunted by something strange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/bb5fdaca8e8dece6ce23cb5d67fd2eb3.poster.avif?t=1741783630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/bb5fdaca8e8dece6ce23cb5d67fd2eb3.webm?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/bb5fdaca8e8dece6ce23cb5d67fd2eb3.mp4?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listening to your microphone and your every move, this AI-driven entity will do anything in its power  to see your face. Every corner you turn is a chance for it to catch you. Listen closely, stay quiet, and be ready to hide your face at all costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not supposed to play this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/8556d4405e706a929aea74e93db46ba8.poster.avif?t=1741783630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/8556d4405e706a929aea74e93db46ba8.webm?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526200/extras/8556d4405e706a929aea74e93db46ba8.mp4?t=1741783630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip out into a mysterious out-of-bounds area and carefully explore. Uncover the truth behind this abandoned game and why \u201cheaven\u201d is so deeply hidden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Webcam based interactions\u00a0\u2013 Hide from the monster by physically moving in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone interaction\u00a0\u2013  Stay quiet, or it will hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fourth-wall breaking horror\u00a0\u2013 Expect the unexpected.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense stealth and chase sequences\u00a0\u2013 Survive against the AI-driven entity hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and discovery - Carefully explore this strange game and uncover its mystery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional notes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses your webcam <strong>only for gameplay purposes</strong>\u2014all processing happens <strong>locally on your computer</strong>. No images, videos, or data are collected or sent anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can turn off the webcam mechanic in settings at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a work in progress\u2014features and visuals may change before release. </p></li></ul>",
