ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fourth-wall breaking horror\u00a0\u2013 Expect the unexpected.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense stealth and chase sequences\u00a0\u2013 Survive against the AI-driven entity hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and discovery - Carefully explore this strange game and uncover its mystery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional notes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses your webcam <strong>only for gameplay purposes</strong>\u2014all processing happens <strong>locally on your computer</strong>. No images, videos, or data are collected or sent anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can turn off the webcam mechanic in settings at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a work in progress\u2014features and visuals may change before release. </p></li></ul>",
